      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "I‑70 runs through the community, linking it 15 miles east to the Pennsylvania Turnpike and 25 miles west to Washington.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
