      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lynnwood-Pricedale%2C_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Lynnwood-Pricedale's roots trace back to early coal mining, with remnants of old operations still visible in local architecture.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15
